# Revised AI Coder Prompt — PayChain Trustee Banking Platform on Railway

Build a production-oriented platform named:

# PayChain Trustee Banking and Reserve Platform

The platform will be deployed on Railway and will serve two controlled client platforms:

```text
paychain.cambobia.com
paykh.cambobia.com
```

The trustee platform is the authoritative institutional layer for:

* Trustee-held money
* Safeguarded funds
* Reserve funds
* Fiat deposit confirmation
* Fiat payout confirmation
* Reserve availability
* Mint authorization
* Redemption funding
* Merchant settlement
* Program funding
* Proof of reserve
* Financial reconciliation
* Compliance controls
* Regulatory evidence
* Trustee-bank approvals

The platform must not be designed only for stablecoin issuance.

It must provide reusable trustee-bank services to both PayChain and PayKH.

