# 21. Trustee Ledger

Use a double-entry ledger for all trustee-controlled money.

Examples:

## PayKH Payment Collection

```text
Debit  ASSET:TRUSTEE_BANK_CASH
Credit LIABILITY:PAYKH_MERCHANT_PAYABLE
```

## Merchant Settlement

```text
Debit  LIABILITY:PAYKH_MERCHANT_PAYABLE
Credit ASSET:TRUSTEE_BANK_CASH
```

## Cashback Program Funding

```text
Debit  ASSET:TRUSTEE_BANK_CASH
Credit LIABILITY:PAYKH_CASHBACK_PROGRAM
```

## PayChain Stable-Value Funding

```text
Debit  ASSET:PAYCHAIN_RESERVE_CASH
Credit LIABILITY:PAYCHAIN_RESERVE_OBLIGATION
```

## Redemption Payout

```text
Debit  LIABILITY:PAYCHAIN_RESERVE_OBLIGATION
Credit ASSET:PAYCHAIN_RESERVE_CASH
```

Never edit posted journals.

Correct errors through compensating entries.

