# 33. Non-Negotiable Rule

The Trustee Banking Platform must serve both PayChain and PayKH while preserving clear responsibility:

```text
PayKH determines why a customer or merchant should pay or receive value.

PayChain determines how approved digital value is issued, transferred, redeemed or burned.

The Trustee Banking Platform determines whether real bank money exists, is cleared, is safeguarded and may legally support the requested financial action.
```
